  "text": "The scheme aims to handle 15% more floodwater, protect urban Kaitāia against a 1-in-100-year flood, and surrounding areas against a 1-in-20-year flood. Accelerated by COVID-19 recovery funding, the project is set to complete in two years instead of six, reducing risk exposure and easing local ratepayer pressure.",
